GIMP Palette
Name: Pallid Keep - Portal (mirror panes)
Columns: 2
# The map's signature object. FOUR twins, because a pane's colour is how the player knows where it comes out: green goes to green, and the pairing has to be readable across the whole arena with no line drawn between them.
#
# The four hues are spread as far apart on the wheel as the map allows: green 140,
# cyan 190, vermilion 15, magenta 315. Two rules constrain the choice —
#   * nothing amber or yellow-gold, because accent-gold means "pickup" on every map
#     and a portal must never be mistaken for one. Vermilion is the closest approach
#     and stays clearly red-orange against gold's muted yellow.
#   * the ghostlight group gave up cyan to make room for the cyan twin.
#
# Each twin is a dark body and a bright glow. The frame pair is shared by all four.
